 "internal_silences": [],
 "text": "How you start the morning often shapes the whole day. My routine is short and simple. I wake up at the same time, even on weekends. I drink a glass of water before anything else. Then I spend ten minutes stretching on the floor. After that, I write down the three most important tasks for the day. I do not check my phone until breakfast is over. This keeps the first hour quiet and focused. Your routine need not to look like mine. The point is to choose a few steps and repeat them every day. Over a few weeks, a quiet start can change how the whole week feels."
